# Frontend TSX

- Functional components with explicit TypeScript types for props and API data.
- Reuse components in `src/components/`, hooks, and Zustand stores before adding abstractions.
- UI library: Ant Design. Icons: `@ant-design/icons`, `react-icons`, or Font Awesome as existing pages do.

## State

- Global auth/user: `useUserStore` (`src/store/userStore.ts`)
- Role-specific: `useSeekerStore`, `useCompanyStore`
- Local UI state: `useState` in the page/component

## i18n

- Use `useTranslation("namespace")` — namespaces: `shared`, `common`, `auth`, `job`, `jobseeker`, `employer`, `admin`
- Locale files: `public/locales/{vi,en}/*.json`
- Do not hardcode user-visible strings

## API in pages

```typescript
// ✅ Call service layer, read response.data.result
const res = await getAllJobsApi(0, 8);
setJobList(res.data.result.data ?? []);

// ❌ Do not use raw axios in pages — use src/services/*Api.ts
```

- Error messages: `getApiErrorMessage` from `@/utils/apiError`
- User alerts: SweetAlert2 (`Swal`) or Ant Design `message`/`notification` — match surrounding page

## Routing & auth

- Routes: `src/routes/index.tsx` and role modules (`PrivateRoutes`, `EmployerPrivateRoute`, etc.)
- Guards: `src/components/route/` (`PrivateRoute`, `EmployerPrivateRoute`, …)
- Roles: `ROLE` from `@/types/common.types` — `ADMIN`, `EMPLOYER`, `SEEKER`

## Styling

- Colocated `.scss` or Sass modules next to component
- Shared styles: `src/styles/`
